Given smarty (tags in class attribute with single quotes):
  <div class="{$variable|replace:'foo':'bar'}">
      text
  </div>

Execute (html tags after smarty tag in class with single quotes):
  AssertEqual 'smartyVariable', SyntaxOf('variable')
  AssertEqual 'smartyString', SyntaxOf('foo')
  AssertEqual 'htmlTagName', SyntaxOf('div', 2)

